Hello, everyone!

We've rolled a new patch with visual improvements, and bug fixes!

[h1]REIGN:[/h1]

[h2]Fixes:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed an issue where "Mutistrike" could make a unit's ATK indicator too small to read; ([i]Please note that the indicators -- the numbers -- can now show up out of the card bounds. This is not a bug. [/i])
[*] Fixed an issue where "Possessed Chef" could sometimes heal Alaric;
[*] Fixed an issue where "Forced Split" could sometimes not work properly;
[*] Fixed an issue where the Beast's upgrade "Pack: At the start of your turn, give a front friendly minion +2 Armor." showed the wrong description during battles;
[*] Fixed an issue where "Soultaker" had the wrong description during the battle;
[*] Fixed an issue where standard "Feed" buffs weren't applied to "Nema, Moon Child 1", "Nema, Moon Child 2" and "Nema, Moon Child 3";
[*] Fixed an issue where 2x and 3x speeds (1 arrow & 2 arrows highlighted) could break card animations;
[*] Applied multiple grammar fixes.
[/list]

[h1]DELIVERANCE:[/h1]

[h2]Visual Improvements:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Moved the "Health" counter to where the "Buff\Debuff" slot was, and moved the "Buff\Debuff" slot downwards a bit;
[*] Fixed an issue with the background not stretching during the mode selection on some wide displays.
[/list]

[h2]Balance Changes for the Druid Class:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Soar - Eagle Form bonus now draws 1 additional card instead of 2;
[*] Dive - Now draws 1 card instead of 2 cards;
[*] Glide - You can no longer draw additional cards for the rest of the turn once you play this;
[*] Migration - Eagle Form now draws 4 cards instead of 5;
[*] Choking Roots - The first option now deals 2 damage instead of 4 and gains 20 Spirit instead of 10. The second option now deals 4 damage instead of 8;
[*] Empowered Transform - Now draws 2 cards instead of 3 from its second option.
[/list]

[h2]Changes made to the Druid's Loadout - Starting Items:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Replaced "Sigil of Power" with "Sacrificial Dagger";
[*] Replaced "Swift Potion" with "Sack".
[/list]

[h2]Changes made to the Druid's Loadout - Unlockable Items:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Replaced "Sleep Potion" with "Peasants Ring";
[*] Replaced "Light Bow" with "Suspicious Eggs";
[*] Replaced "Amulet of Life" with "Light Bow";
[*] Replaced "Mystical Wand" with "Chaos Ring" and increased its price from 100 to 125.
[/list]

[h2]Deliverance's Fixes:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed a bug where the enemy "Demon Warrior" gained +1 Anger even when the player's attack dealt 0 damage.
[/list]

[h2]Reign's Fixes:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed a bug with "Cataclysm" and its damage calculation;
[*] Fixed a bug with some Spell effects not working properly if the Spell used the floor itself as a target;
[*] Fixed a bug with the Betrayer Spell Upgrade "+20 spell damage" not being applied properly to Spells;
[*] Fixed a bug with the Vampire Spell Upgrade "Feed a random friendly minion" not prioritizing Unfed units;
[*] Fixed a bug with "Doppelganger" not considering Upgrades from the Minions it copied;
[*] Fixed a bug where "Doppelganger" didn't keep its own Upgrades when transforming into a different Minion;
[*] Grammar tweaks.
[/list]

[h2]Deliverance's Fixes:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed some grammar issues with the card "Preparation";
[*] Fixed a major bug where Alaric had a chance of duplicating himself;
[*] Fixed a game-breaking bug where using "Divine Shell" with no enemies left on the room caused a hard lock;
[*] Fixed a couple of issues where effects that prevented you from "Drawing" cards were mistakenly keeping you from placing cards on your hands by different means (such as "Adding");
[*] Tweaked multiple cards to improve balance;
[*] Fixed some small grammar issues;
[*] "Surge" now does not cause you to draw 1 less card during the next turn;
[*] Fixed an issue where finishing a battle with "Final Recital" or "16 Point Palm Strike" bugged the Loot\Reward menu that shows post-battle, and made it impossible to pick rewards properly.
[/list]

[h2]Reign's Fixes:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Tweaked multiple cards for enhanced balance;
[*] Temporary Cards are now also discarded whenever they are used;
[*] Fixed a bug where drawing cards with the "Cycle" effect sometimes removed their upgrades.
[/list]

Hello everyone,
We're excited to announce the latest patch for Deliverance & Reign! 
Our team has been hard at work addressing your feedback and suggestions to enhance your gaming experience.
In this new patch, we made significant improvements to sound and visual effects, fixed grammar mistakes, and resolved pesky bugs reported by our community. 
We have also implemented [b]major improvements for Reign[/b], including new descriptions for Mystery Events, and visual enhancements for menus and Hands.

For a complete changelog of this patch, please check the end of this post!

Thank you for your continuous support, and stay tuned for more exciting updates! ːsteamhappyː


**********************************
[h1]Changelog:[/h1]
**********************************
[h2]Deliverance[/h2]

[b]Fixes applied to:[/b]
[olist]
[*] SFX volume being too loud;
[*] Lagging HP/Power counters;
[*] Tutorial prompts;
[*] Grammar;
[*] Problem with saving/loading during a Level Up or Battle Loot screen;
[*] Gold counter during runs;
[*] Performance Drop during Grim Reaper fights.
[/olist]

[b]New Content & Other Tweaks:[/b]
[olist]
[*] Dying now only forfeits 50% of the total Gold you acquired in your run!
[/olist]
**********************************
[h2]Reign[/h2]

[b]Fixes applied to:[/b]
[olist]
[*] Grammar;
[*] Intro Cutscene’s sound;
[*] Imps;
[*] Player & Enemy Units Capping;
[*] Tutorial VFX;
[*] Artwork misplaced\missing
[*] Settings button not working during Faction Selection;
[*] Battle Preview font size;
[*] Multiple fixes to Mystery Events;
[*] Day Counter (until next enemy arrives);
[/olist]

[b]New Content & Other Tweaks:[/b]
[olist]
[*] Personalized “Battle Preview” text to fit the approaching enemy;
[*] Enhanced visuals in menus after battles;
[*] Enhanced keyword visualization;
[*] Cards in hand are now presented similarly to Deliverance;
[*] Hugely improved Events & Mystery Events.
[/olist]
**********************************
[h2]General Improvements:[/h2]
[olist]
[*] Settings are now shared between both game modes.
[/olist]
**********************************
[h2]Known Issues:[/h2]
[olist]
[*] Some Mystery Events are not showing their proper descriptions;
[*] Small visual bug with the new Card Presentation in Reign, where units behind the presented card show in front of it for a brief second.
[/olist]
**********************************

Hello everyone, 
We've rolled a new patch to fix some issues and add new features to our Deliverance & Reign Demo!


Thank you for the continuous support, and please, keep reporting anything amiss you may find!


You can report your findings directly to our Discord (https://discord.com/invite/QCPZuva94D), or you can use Steam Discussions for it.

-------------------
[b]Patch Notes:[/b]


[b]Reign:[/b]
Description for "[b]Discarded Cards[/b]" fixed;

[b]Deliverance:[/b]
Labels for Card Types added directly to card Art;
Extra Labels for Card Types added when "Zoomed Card In Battle" is disabled;
Fixed a bug with "Blessing of Revenge" not triggering in certain situations;
Fixed a bug where your "Targeting Arrow" got stuck to a target, even if you moved it away;
-------------------
